// The executable's icon, linked into mainframe.exe by both native profiles.
//
// Ordinal 1, and it is the only icon here, because Windows shows a program's *lowest-numbered* icon resource
// wherever it shows the program itself -- Explorer, the taskbar's pinned button, a shortcut, the Apps entry.
// mainframe.ico is mainframe.svg (the suite icon canvas's MainFrame primary, dark) rendered at 16 to 256 px by
// vex-suite-common's tools/Ico.java. The window, file and light variants are kept beside it.
1 ICON "mainframe.ico"
